          <attvalue for="35" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="A sustained increase in weapons and munitions deliveries intensifies combat operations and the risk of supply‑chain disruptions (notably energy, agriculture and shipping), leading to sudden repricing and higher realized and implied volatility across equities, bonds and FX markets." />
