          <attvalue for="35" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="A sustained increase in weapons and munitions flows into the Ukraine theater leads Russia to divert materiel and authorize or bolster proxy and client strikes in the Middle East (to offset battlefield losses and signal deterrence), increasing the rate of hostile incidents against regional energy targets." />
