          <attvalue for="35" value="0.8" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Heightened risk of energy supply interruptions raises uncertainty about corporate earnings and inflation, triggering rapid repricing and higher realized and implied volatility across equities, bonds and FX as investors widen risk premia." />
