          <attvalue for="35" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Rising attacks or interdictions at major maritime chokepoints elevate insurance and trade‑finance costs and spike geopolitical risk premia, causing foreign investors to reduce exposures to affected markets and withdraw portfolio capital." />
