          <attvalue for="29" value="3" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="0.75" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Elevated sovereign yields push up benchmark borrowing costs and tighten lender risk appetites for long‑dated project finance, directly reducing the rate at which new debt‑backed AI/data‑center projects receive funding." />
