          <attvalue for="29" value="3" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="0.75" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Sharp swings in cross-border capital flows from Western markets drive FX and liquidity stress that forces margin calls and speculative rebalances in oil and gas markets, amplifying short-term volatility in Middle Eastern energy prices." />
