          <attvalue for="35" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Sharp cross‑border capital volatility disrupts payment channels, raises insurance and hedging costs and prompts private suppliers and intermediaries to delay or reduce deliveries of arms and munitions to the theater." />
