          <attvalue for="35" value="0.55" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Large net capital outflows from allied or regional markets force governments to prioritize financial-stability interventions and domestic crisis management, diverting political bandwidth and slowing the speed of collective military and foreign-policy decision-making related to the conflict." />
